https://github.com/esaueng/OpenZCAD (commit c1855496197147b80d99ef39b705e907000f6baf)

The Studio's browser kernel worker (src/studio/browserKernel/) adopts the geometry-worker
design described in OpenZCAD's docs (one worker, document as the source of truth, jobs
tagged with document/version/request ids, one in flight plus the latest pending, a
bounded content-keyed rebuild cache, a click-to-frame edit benchmark). rebuildCache.ts and
tests/perf/paramEditFrame.spec.ts are adapted from OpenZCAD's exactRebuildCache.ts and
perf-cad-edit.spec.ts. The Apache License 2.0 text is at
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.
